WEBVTT

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:16.000
I dreamt last night the moon
was so bright it melted away

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.001
and it wasn't alarming when I saw a
prince charming come into my bedroom

00:00:22.001 --> 00:00:29.001
and say let me persuade
you to come to the place

00:00:29.001 --> 00:00:32.001
where tomorrow meets today.

00:00:33.001 --> 00:00:39.000
Oh, thank you. It sounds very exciting.
May I come just as I am?

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Hey, girls don't go to more trommers
dressed in a pair of pink pajamas.

00:00:47.001 --> 00:00:52.001
Maybe they don't, but I don't care.
Haven't got a single thing to wear.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.001
Quick, please, a gown.

00:00:54.001 --> 00:00:57.001
Ooh, I'll be the talk of the town.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.001
Oh, my. Go after it. Why?

00:01:02.001 --> 00:01:07.000
I followed my heart through the night
past a thousand windows yellowed light.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.001
Down, down it fell and it landed
in the Wodorf Astoria Hotel.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:37.000
I'm a girl who happens to think that
a brand new car is better than me.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:38.001
Excited?

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:42.001
Denied. So glad I got invited.

00:01:43.001 --> 00:01:47.001
Since it's just a dream and involves no money,
which one would you

00:01:47.001 --> 00:01:49.000
like me to buy you, honey?

00:01:54.001 --> 00:02:00.000
They are all so beautiful. I really don't know.
So let me go down, get the load

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.001
down, and look at each one much closer.

00:02:06.001 --> 00:02:15.000
I want a Corvette.

00:02:16.001 --> 00:02:18.000
I thought you would.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:24.001
Ooh, I want a Pontiac too.

00:02:26.001 --> 00:02:29.000
Okay, we'll have the usual two-car garage.

00:02:32.001 --> 00:02:35.000
How do you feel about this final's mobile?

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:39.001
It's easy to see myself taking the wheel.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:45.000
This Buick's a beaut.

00:02:45.001 --> 00:02:46.001
I'll try it.

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:52.000
Ooh, what a dream he writes.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:00.000
I think that we ought to buy it.

00:03:03.001 --> 00:03:07.000
Let's go all out and buy a Cadillac too.

00:03:09.001 --> 00:03:14.001
I can hardly wait for this dream to come true.

00:03:15.001 --> 00:03:17.001
Hey, Lenny, you're right for the joy.

00:03:18.001 --> 00:03:20.000
Better get her into the kitchen quick.

00:03:25.001 --> 00:03:32.001
Just like a

00:03:32.001 --> 00:03:37.001
man, you give him a break,
and you run up in the kitchen,

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:40.000
baking a cake.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:43.000
But this was a kitchen like none I've seen.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:47.001
Put a card in the slot, and onto the screen
pops a picture of just how your dish

00:03:47.001 --> 00:03:50.001
will look,
plus all the ingredients you need to cook.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:04:01.000
No need for the bride to feel tragic.
The rest is push-button magic.

00:04:01.001 --> 00:04:05.000
So whether you bake or broil or stew,
the Bridget Air

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:06.001
kitchen does it all for you.

00:04:06.001 --> 00:04:11.000
Don't have to be chained to the stove all day.
Just set the timer,

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.001
and you're on your way.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:22.000
Tick tock, tick tock,
I'm free to have fun around the clock.

00:04:40.001 --> 00:04:42.001
Jeepers, I'm exhausted.

00:04:46.001 --> 00:04:50.000
The kitchen of tomorrow is calling me.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:53.001
My cake is ready.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:06.000
Time for the show, everybody on stage.

00:05:10.001 --> 00:05:17.001
And now, a glamorous dancer and a special

00:05:17.001 --> 00:05:19.001
number, Dance of Tomorrow.

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:30.000
Everyone says the future is strange,
but I have a feeling

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.001
some things won't change.

00:05:54.001 --> 00:05:57.001
Now, the dream car is up tomorrow.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:05.001
A magnificent El Dorado town car by Cadillac.

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:09.000
Ensemble by Christian Dior of Paris.

00:06:14.001 --> 00:06:19.001
Buick presents the sleek Centurion.

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.000
Driving coat by Montesano of New York.

00:06:31.001 --> 00:06:33.001
Oldsmobile's elegant golden rocket.

00:06:34.001 --> 00:06:37.000
Sports outfits by Cap Primo of Los Angeles.

00:06:45.001 --> 00:06:48.001
Pontiac's Club de Mer, open to the sky.

00:06:49.001 --> 00:06:51.000
Costume by Emilio Capri.

00:07:00.001 --> 00:07:03.000
[...] is impala graceful and swift.

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:05.001
Silk casual by Digby Morton of London.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:15.001
And last of all, designed for the

00:07:15.001 --> 00:07:22.000
electronic highway of the future,
the fabulous turbine powered Firebird 2.

00:07:59.000 --> 00:07:59.001
Firebird 2 will be the control tower.

00:07:59.001 --> 00:08:00.000
Why, it's you!

00:08:01.001 --> 00:08:04.000
Firebird 2 to control tower.

00:08:04.001 --> 00:08:06.001
We are about to take off on
the highway of tomorrow.

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:08.001
Stand by.

00:08:08.001 --> 00:08:38.001
[...]

00:09:07.001 --> 00:09:08.000
[...]

00:09:08.001 --> 00:09:20.001
[...]
